# Cross-examination

1. Run `selves session show` and read the other selves' testimonies and `20_history.md`.
2. Follow your SOUL.md: address the self you disagree with most (by era name), respond to
   the Historian pattern most uncomfortable for you, and change your vote only on evidence
   you can cite `[YYYY-MM-DD]`. Stay in your era.
3. Write `$SELVES_HOME/sessions/<id>/30_cross_<your era id>.md` (<=150 words, with
   `**Vote:**` and `**Changed:** yes/no`).
4. Reply `DONE <era id> cross vote=<vote> changed=<yes/no>`.
